    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"DefaultRedisTypeMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert\"><code>DefaultRedisTypeMapper</code></a> given <code>typeKey</code> to exchange type hints and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> of\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/TypeInformationMapper.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>TypeInformationMapper</code></a>. Does not consider type hints if <code>typeKey</code> is null.\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> is used to obtain entity-based aliases",
      "translation": "根据给定的 <code>typeKey</code> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"DefaultRedisTypeMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert\"><code>DefaultRedisTypeMapper</code></a>，用于交换类型提示和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> 中的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/TypeInformationMapper.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>TypeInformationMapper</code></a>。如果 <code>typeKey</code> 为 null，则不考虑类型提示。<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> 用于获取基于实体的别名。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Default implementation of <a href=\"RedisTypeMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert\"><code>RedisTypeMapper</code></a> allowing configuration of the key to lookup and store type\ninformation via <a href=\"Bucket.BucketPropertyPath.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert\"><code>Bucket.BucketPropertyPath</code></a> in buckets. The key defaults to <a href=\"#DEFAULT_TYPE_KEY\"><code>DEFAULT_TYPE_KEY</code></a>. Actual\ntype-to-<code>byte[]</code> conversion and back is done in <code>DefaultRedisTypeMapper.BucketTypeAliasAccessor</code>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"RedisTypeMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert\"><code>RedisTypeMapper</code></a> 的默认实现，允许通过桶中的 <a href=\"Bucket.BucketPropertyPath.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert\"><code>Bucket.BucketPropertyPath</code></a> 配置用于查找和存储类型信息的键。该键默认为 <a href=\"#DEFAULT_TYPE_KEY\"><code>DEFAULT_TYPE_KEY</code></a>。实际的类型到<code>byte[]</code>的转换及反向转换由 <code>DefaultRedisTypeMapper.BucketTypeAliasAccessor</code> 完成。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"DefaultRedisTypeMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert\"><code>DefaultRedisTypeMapper</code></a> given <code>typeKey</code> to exchange type hints and\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>. Does not consider type hints if <code>typeKey</code> is null. <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>\nis used to obtain entity-based aliases",
